    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nFor Sale by Private Treaty or Auction at a Later Date\n\nThis exceptionally well-located detached bungalow-style residence occupies a central position within the vibrant village of Murrintown. Situated just five minutes' drive from Wexford Town Centre. This home is positioned on a generous site extending to approx. 0.52 Hectares (1.28 Acres) Offering immense potential for development.\n\nConvenience is at your doorstep, with a local crèche, shop, bus stop, church, primary school & the village community centre.\n\nIf you're searching for a home in a lovely village or a site with enormous potential this property is certainly not one to be missed. Early viewing comes highly recommended to fully appreciate the vast potential on offer"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.75m x 4.15m & 1 x 8.6\nWith tile flooring\n\nLiving Room - 4.3m x 5.6m\nWith wood flooring, brick fireplace & T.V point\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 3.6m x 6.2m\nWith fitted waist & eye level units & tile splashback\n\nHotpress 1m x 2m - \n\n\nShower Room - 2m x 2.25m\nFilly tiles, WC, WHB, Mira Electric Shower\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.5m x 3.15m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.5m x 3m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 3m x 3.15m\n\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.65m x 4.4m\n\n\nEn-Suite - 1.3m x 2.65m\nW WC, WHB, tiled shower\n\nServices - \nMains water, mains sewage, ESB & broadband\n\n"
      },
